Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 19:11:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(command): edit native command block settings

Open the Java command editor for an authoritative native COMMAND_BLOCK window. Retain the native TickDelay and ExecuteOnFirstTick fields, advertise the complete edit payload, and close the matching native window when the editor closes. Java 26.3 lacks these two Bedrock 1.26.51.1 fields. Preserve operator permission and loaded block-entity checks. Core bounded codec and session tests plus addon compilation validate the editor bridge.
